{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taat is a 2D family friendly sokoban-style puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic and newer puzzle games, taat brings the joy of solving puzzles to everyone!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute 2D pixel art visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appropriate soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different save slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of puzzle mechanics including breaking walls, lasers, portals, traps and ... chickens!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick manual</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game autosaves after each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial explains the controls and the details of the mechanics of some elements. It's recommended to leave it on for the first playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickens react consistently to obstacles (player, walls, boxes).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a level looks hard, don't rush through it. Take some time to observe what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: Arrow keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 2 Movement: W,A,S,D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset Level: Backspace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select menu item: Enter or Space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit to main menu, go to previous menu item : ESC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon game completion, Jump to previous/next level: Comma (,) and Period (.) respectively</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: Pad, Left analog stick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset Level: Y</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select menu item: A</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit to main menu, go to previous menu item : B</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon game completion, Jump to previous/next level: Shoulder Buttons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using Steam Input is recommended</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Procrastination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220160/8ddb3d2565a5cf8a54460aa8a7477a9f50186b47.jpg"},{"name":"Breaking the wall!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220160/dd1d601623842b3fbf9e511965f754100c419c1f.jpg"},{"name":"Getting our feet wet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220160/7215b090730059025612bc6180ddece6e5c74d3e.jpg"},{"name":"The great reset","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220160/8b75b6bb51b659a2e48c09e7d61fa7ed19ce366b.jpg"},{"name":"3 / 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220160/64e3e09672fea58fc9ea86289f5c28d036ced017.jpg"},{"name":"Puzzle solver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220160/c8012e970b9ca2ee5c775655b2c3ba9721efd232.jpg"},{"name":"Mega puzzle solver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220160/49a77dedb3ce509f5b67384349dc9ba83987d072.jpg"},{"name":"Ultra puzzle solver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220160/3e0d99641d0b4db38a3c62b660d5a2748c0a65a5.jpg"},{"name":"Rhythmic chickens ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220160/5e1afd8c569f68f9e84d648379d1a14154043fe0.jpg"},{"name":"Traveller in Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220160/96b20173b9d7e16711ec6973f102b92f947